# Models/Data
# NOTE: model_artifacts/*.pkl are intentionally NOT ignored (see the README
# in that directory) — they're the pre-trained fallback the demo needs on a
# fresh clone with no MODEL_STORE_URI configured. Do not re-add this ignore
# rule without also fixing PredictionService to fail loudly (not silently
# heuristic-fallback) when no real models are available.
backend/data/
dataset/*.csv
dataset/*.txt
dataset/*.parquet
dataset/cleaned/
